---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import truck from '../assets/gallery/truck-side.jpg';
---

<section class="why section" aria-labelledby="why-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Why folks call us first</span>
      <h2 id="why-h">A family business that answers the phone.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <span class="tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <div>
            <strong>A person answers the phone.</strong>
            <span
              >You get the shop instead of a call center. Tell us what the system is doing and we
              will tell you what happens next.</span
            >
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <div>
            <strong>The price comes before the work.</strong>
            <span
              >You approve a written price before we start, and the invoice matches it. We are not
              going to find three more things wrong once we are already in your basement.</span
            >
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <div>
            <strong>We know Longmont houses.</strong>
            <span
              >The older ranches in town and the new builds out east have their own quirks. Odds are
              we have worked on your floor plan before.</span
            >
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Licensed and insured.</strong>
            <span
              >We put down drop cloths and we leave the work area the way we found it. You should
              not be able to tell we were there except that the system works.</span
            >
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <figure class="why-photo">
        <Image
          src={truck}
          alt="Loos & Sons HVAC service truck with the company logo on the door"
          widths={[560, 1000]}
          sizes="(min-width: 880px) 42vw, 92vw"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>
      <p class="photo-cap">The truck you have seen around town.</p>
      <p class="photo-cap"><a href="/gallery/">See more of our work</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
